A-1 Organics
Date Prepared:
August 7, 2012
The above referenced contract is hereby amended or modified in the matter set forth in
the following, and such amendments and modifications of the plans and specifications
are agreed to by the undersigned, being parties to this contract and agreement.  All other
aspects of the original agreement remains unchanged and in full force and effect.
I.  Description of Changes
Extend the current contract one year.
II.  Contract Items
All items to remain the same as original Contract.
III  Schedule
Contract is based on one year extension and expires August 2013.
IV.  Summary
Total Original Contract Amount (two years). Second contract modification extension of
one year.  This is a “not to exceed” contract.  The Contractor shall charge and the City
shall pay for actual services rendered at the prices listed in the original contract.
